# Change scenes
@scenario office_lesson_05
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk wave]
pip: The office lights dip. The next sentence feels like the start of a different shift.
[if !tutorial_still]
[transition fade 380]
[endif]
[stage dusk]
pip: Compare the fade duration with a short cut. Keep the dialogue and pose the same.
@label check
pip: Which value changes how long the fade lasts?
> The duration in milliseconds. -> correct
> The number of dialogue lines. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Timing belongs to the transition, so the script can keep its pacing. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Timing belongs to the transition, so the script can keep its pacing.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_05]
[flag tutorial_done_05]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
